    "type": "page",
    "link": "https://danikalaw.com/baby-february-2021/",
    "title": {
      "rendered": "Baby Registry"
    },
    "content": {
      "rendered": "\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text alignwide is-stacked-on-mobile\" style=\"grid-template-columns:32% auto\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"682\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://danikalaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/DSCF0036-1-682x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-451\" srcset=\"https://danikalaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/DSCF0036-1-682x1024.jpg 682w, https://danikalaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/DSCF0036-1-200x300.jpg 200w, https://danikalaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/DSCF0036-1-768x1153.jpg 768w, https://danikalaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/DSCF0036-1-1023x1536.jpg 1023w, https://danikalaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/DSCF0036-1-rotated.jpg 1154w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 682px) 100vw, 682px\" /></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<p class=\"has-large-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Garrett and I are excited to be having a baby in February 2021!</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We created this page to direct you to in case you have asked if there is anything you could get us to help welcome our family&#8217;s newest member.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Gifts are appreciated, but not expected. Your presence in our lives and our future child&#8217;s life is a gift in itself. &lt;3</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://danikalaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/DSCF0055-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-452\" width=\"414\" height=\"276\" srcset=\"https://danikalaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/DSCF0055-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://danikalaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/DSCF0055-300x200.jpg 300w, https://danikalaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/DSCF0055-768x512.jpg 768w, https://danikalaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/DSCF0055-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://danikalaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/DSCF0055-2048x1365.jpg 2048w, https://danikalaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/DSCF0055-1568x1045.jpg 1568w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 414px) 100vw, 414px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Registries &amp; Gift Ideas</h3>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Amazon.ca</h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Want to purchase from Amazon.ca? Check out our registry here: </p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https://www.amazon.ca/baby-reg/garrett-petersen-danika-law-february-2021-burnaby/2AE5XY3KLEMEE\">https://www.amazon.ca/baby-reg/garrett-petersen-danika-law-february-2021-burnaby/2AE5XY3KLEMEE</a></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">You can purchase and order to our house which makes things super convenient since we won&#8217;t be seeing as many people in person in the coming months.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Most items we need are on this list, so have a look if there is anything you want to gift from here first! The list says if something has already been purchased, so please check to avoid duplicate items. Also, some items periodically show as out of stock: We are not often super attached to colour, so feel free to check if it&#8217;s in stock in another colour. </p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Miscellaneous </h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>Note: Please don&#8217;t purchase newborn size baby clothing, we are already all set for this small &amp; short period of our baby&#8217;s growth :-</em>)</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>Bonus extra note: Please include gift receipts where possible, just in case!</em></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https://hazeljools.com/collections/all\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://hazeljools.com/collections/all\">Hazel &amp; Jools </a> is locally designed and produced in Vancouver! If you go in store, they sell baby clothing made from the same soft bamboo. </p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https://bambiandbirdie.com/collections/under-20\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://bambiandbirdie.com/collections/under-20\">Bambi &amp; Birdie</a> is designed in Vancouver, and made in Vancouver or Taiwan. More bamboo! I link to their under $20 page for some super cute hats. </p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https://kytebaby.com/collections/women-s-wear/products/women-s-lounge-dress-fall-collection?variant=31942970343535\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://kytebaby.com/collections/women-s-wear/products/women-s-lounge-dress-fall-collection?variant=31942970343535\">Kyte Baby</a> also sells bamboo clothing (can you tell I have a favourite fabric?). </p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https://www.littleandlively.com/collections/shopkids\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https://www.littleandlively.com/collections/shopkids\">Little &amp; Lively</a> makes adorable children&#8217;s clothes in Canada. </p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Have a favourite book you&#8217;d like to purchase for our baby to read? We would love to have it in our library 🙂 </strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Know of another great store that sells something cute? Fair game.</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Mailing Address</h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you want our mailing address to send us any cards or things, please reach out to danikalaw(at)gmail.com</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Nursery Preview</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This is a sneak peak of what we&#8217;ve been working on to prepare for our little one. Space/sci-fi? Check. Board games? Check. Love? Check. </p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"https://danikalaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/PXL_20201012_042018493-2-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"459\" data-full-url=\"https://danikalaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/PXL_20201012_042018493-2.jpg\" data-link=\"https://danikalaw.com/?attachment_id=459\" class=\"wp-image-459\" srcset=\"https://danikalaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/PXL_20201012_042018493-2-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://danikalaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/PXL_20201012_042018493-2-300x225.jpg 300w, https://danikalaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/PXL_20201012_042018493-2-768x576.jpg 768w, https://danikalaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/PXL_20201012_042018493-2-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://danikalaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/PXL_20201012_042018493-2-1568x1176.jpg 1568w, https://danikalaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/PXL_20201012_042018493-2.jpg 1632w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"650\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://danikalaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/inCollage_20200927_160547958-650x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"456\" data-full-url=\"https://danikalaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/inCollage_20200927_160547958.jpg\" data-link=\"https://danikalaw.com/?attachment_id=456\" class=\"wp-image-456\" srcset=\"https://danikalaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/inCollage_20200927_160547958-650x1024.jpg 650w, https://danikalaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/inCollage_20200927_160547958-190x300.jpg 190w, https://danikalaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/inCollage_20200927_160547958-768x1210.jpg 768w, https://danikalaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/inCollage_20200927_160547958-975x1536.jpg 975w, https://danikalaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/inCollage_20200927_160547958.jpg 1126w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" /></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"433\" height=\"577\" src=\"https://danikalaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/baby-room-picture-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"464\" data-full-url=\"https://danikalaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/baby-room-picture-1.jpg\" data-link=\"https://danikalaw.com/?attachment_id=464\" class=\"wp-image-464\" srcset=\"https://danikalaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/baby-room-picture-1.jpg 433w, https://danikalaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/baby-room-picture-1-225x300.jpg 225w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 433px) 100vw, 433px\" /></figure></li></ul></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Thanks and much love to you all &lt;3</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Stay safe,</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Danika &amp; Garrett</p>\n",
      "protected": false
    },
