      "rendered": "<p>Registries &amp; Gift Ideas Amazon.ca Want to purchase from Amazon.ca? Check out our registry here: https://www.amazon.ca/baby-reg/garrett-petersen-danika-law-february-2021-burnaby/2AE5XY3KLEMEE You can purchase and order to our house which makes things super convenient since we won&#8217;t be seeing as many people in person in the coming months. Most items we need are on this list, so have a look [&hellip;]</p>\n",
