    "link": "https://danikalaw.com/about-me/",
    "title": {
      "rendered": "About me"
    },
    "content": {
      "rendered": "\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"alignleft size-large\"><a href=\"https://danikalaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/familyphotos-teasers-27-2-scaled.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"https://danikalaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/familyphotos-teasers-27-2-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-554\" srcset=\"https://danikalaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/familyphotos-teasers-27-2-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://danikalaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/familyphotos-teasers-27-2-300x200.jpg 300w, https://danikalaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/familyphotos-teasers-27-2-768x512.jpg 768w, https://danikalaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/familyphotos-teasers-27-2-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://danikalaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/familyphotos-teasers-27-2-2048x1365.jpg 2048w, https://danikalaw.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/familyphotos-teasers-27-2-1568x1045.jpg 1568w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></a></figure></div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">When I&#8217;m not using data to inform business decisions, you can find me enjoying life in British Columbia. Some passions include:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li>Community (family &amp; friends)</li><li>Boardgames (favourites include Race for the Galaxy, Concordia, Pandemic Legacy, and Spirit Island)</li><li>Exploring new food, both at restaurants and in the kitchen</li><li>Sci-fi (reading and watching, right now I&#8217;m obsessed with The Expanse)</li><li>Tea (in particular, Taiwanese style oolongs)</li><li>Light hikes outdoors in the mountains</li><li>Music (I play the piano and harp well, and dabble in guitar, mandolin, banjo and more)</li><li>Knitting and crocheting</li></ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The rest of the time, I am a data scientist who loves discovering stories and insights in data. I currently work as a Senior Data &amp; Applied Scientist at Microsoft.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">I enjoy using statistics, machine learning, and data visualization to uncover actionable insights regardless of industry. I especially enjoy projects which push the limits of my expertise, challenging me to expand my depth and breadth of knowledge.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">With extensive experience with R, Python, SQL, and more, I&#8217;m always excited to explore new modelling options and analytical approaches. Rather than focus on the approach, I like to focus on the question: What do you want to learn, and what questions are you seeking answers for that will drive your business to success? </p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n",
      "protected": false
    },
